Attribution to prior work
-------------------------

The 'gen_prompts/' module is derived from the PromptSet project:

  https://github.com/pisterlabs/promptset
  Companion code for the paper "PromptSet: A Programmer's Prompting Dataset"

Imported from commit 607ba7373e5eee4ac6a8de7b8337e0345e6d25fc in 2026-05.
At the time of import, the original repository did not contain an explicit
LICENSE file. The original code is used here as the starting point for
academic research. All modifications and additions beyond the original
gen_prompts module are released under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Components of the original PromptSet repository that were intentionally
excluded from this fork because they are not part of the extraction pipeline:
  - scrape/         (original GitHub scraping scripts)
  - devGPT/         (DevGPT-derived dataset)
  - analytics/      (analysis notebooks from the paper)
  - opro/, opro_gpt4o/  (unrelated experiments)
  - gen_prompts/upload_ds.py  (pushes dataset to pisterlabs' HuggingFace org)

Components removed after the import:
  - gen_prompts/reader.py  (post-processing step of the original pipeline.
    It evaluated expressions taken from the analysed repositories with
    Python's eval(), which conflicts with the requirement that the tool never
    runs third-party code. Neither the validation nor the graphical interface
    used it: both work on the output of gen_prompts/find_prompts.py.)
